      "quote": "Eligible studies were full-text original clinical reports enrolling adults with initially unresectable, initially inoperable, or non-upfront-resectable hepatocellular carcinoma who received conversionintent treatment and were subsequently compared according to hepatectomy versus nonhepatectomy management.",
      "reason": "Population (adults, initially unresectable HCC), intervention/exposure (conversion-intent therapy with hepatectomy vs non-hepatectomy), eligible designs (full-text original clinical reports), and outcome requirements (extractable comparative HRs for OS, PFS, EFS, DFS, or RFS) are all specified."
